        <button type="button" class="tts-preset-btn px-2 py-0.5 text-xs rounded-lg border border-neutral-200 dark:border-neutral-700 hover:border-purple-500 text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-300" data-text="Running artificial intelligence right in the browser is surprisingly fast with WebGPU.">
